    "description": "PCLOUD-014 (pCloud): an rsync --delete run (temp file renamed over each existing file) reported success but some files kept their older versions on pCloud. Rules P10/P11 (sync-chaos port-editor-save): an atomic save is one change; the temp names never reach the drive; the pass right after the burst carries every new version.",
